#arabic-letters
#ba ب 

Tuesday, July 16, 2019 11:15 AM

- #divine-names
ب	12	Al Baari	البارئ	The Maker
ب	21	Al Baasit	الباسط	The Expander, the Munificent
ب	27	Al Basir	البصير	The All-Seeing
ب	49	Al Ba'ith	الباعث	The Raiser of the Dead
ب	76	Al Baatin	الباطن	The Hidden; the All Encompassing
ب	79	Al Barr	البر	The Most Kind and Righteous
ب	95	Al Badi'i	البديع	Incomparable, the Originator
ب	96	Al Baaqi	الباقي	The Ever Enduring and Immutable


- (ba) means skin (= بَشَر = bashar) and it is well known that the scorpion’s skin is unique and fluorescent, a property which is used to find scorpions using black-light or fluorescent light

- The ب here is for the piece (only the surface layer of the land similar to a skin) of land (= بَ ر = barr) on which is the foundation of the house (represented by the dot under the ب)

- the two ب represent two rooms, the dots representing the foundations of the rooms and the ا is the leaf of a door (= the moving part of the door). The space between the ا and ب is the empty space when the door is open

- ب is below the horizon

- The ب indicates land (only surface). Therefore south is the direction where a lot of land is hidden under the snow that is to say the Antarctic which is the largest snow or ice covered (permanently) land known on planet earth

- is for the surface of water which is indicated by the dot
The ب also looks like a boat

Along with , within atmosphere, name or the sound, Unity or the One Being




